#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "Graphviz Dependencies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Basic usage of <application>Graphviz</application> does not require any "
"libraries out of what is found in the LFS book. Its <quote>core</quote> "
"rendering engine is able to generate several graphic formats, such as "
"Postscript, SVG, VML, .fig, and Tk. Those formats can be converted to almost"
" any other format using tools from packages such as <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"imagemagick\"/>. The dependencies below add the ability to "
"generate graph images in bitmap format, to display the graph image on "
"screen, to edit a graph by viewing the resulting image directly, or to view "
"large graphs. Since <application>Graphviz</application> is a dependency of "
"several other packages in this book, it is suggested that you first build it"
" without any dependencies, and then rebuild it when you have built enough "
"packages to suit your needs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref linkend=\"cmake\"/>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended, for needed bitmap outputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"pango\"/>, with <xref linkend=\"cairo\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"xorg7-lib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"fontconfig\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libpng\"/>, to generate images in bitmap SVG, postscript, PNG, and"
" PDF formats, or to display the image on screen. The PNG output is required "
"for building <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"gegl\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional, for additional bitmap outputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"aalib\"/> (for outputting images in ASCII art), <xref "
"linkend=\"cups\"/> (for formatting graphs for printing), <xref "
"linkend=\"qt6\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"webkitgtk\"/>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Adding &gtk2; with <xref linkend=\"libjpeg\"/> adds support for JPEG, BMP, "
"TIF, and ICO formats, and allows displaying the image in a GTK+ window"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://www.libgd.org/\">GD Library</ulink> may be used instead"
" of <application>Pango</application>. It adds the ability to generate images"
" in GIF, VRML, and GD formats, but <application>Pango</application> provides"
" better outputs for the other formats, and is needed for displaying images"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Other formats may be added with <xref linkend=\"libwebp\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://openil.sourceforge.net/projects.php\">DevIL</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/lasi/\">libLASi</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/glitz\">glitz</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Optional (to load graphics that may be displayed inside the nodes of a "
"graph)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgs.so</filename> from <xref "
"linkend=\"gs\"/>, <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"poppler\"/>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional (to build more tools)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.cs.umd.edu/~mount/ANN/\">libANN</ulink> and <xref "
"linkend=\"freeglut\"/> (with <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/gtkglext/\">GtkGLExt</ulink> and "
